{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a dreamlike world of color and calm.<br>Armed with a simple wand, you journey across rolling hills and glowing fields, where violet light meets drifting clouds. The world feels quiet, alive, and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach the final tower \u2014 a monument of shadow and mystery \u2014 you must awaken the four Elemental Towers scattered across the land. Each holds the essence of a natural force: Air, Earth, Water, and Fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no story to follow, no quest markers, and no time to race against. Only you, your wand, and the beauty around you. Cast elemental magic, restore balance, and lose yourself in a tranquil half-hour of light and sound.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122370?t=1770270449","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122370?t=1770270449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122370/a9f247b45e1d6ae19c628cbca590b35374240682/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770270449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122370/a9f247b45e1d6ae19c628cbca590b35374240682/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770270449","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a dreamlike world of color and calm.<br>Armed with a simple wand, you journey across rolling hills and glowing fields, where violet light meets drifting clouds. The world feels quiet, alive, and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach the final tower \u2014 a monument of shadow and mystery \u2014 you must awaken the four Elemental Towers scattered across the land. Each holds the essence of a natural force: Air, Earth, Water, and Fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Th